flowchart LR
  goal["说明目标"]
  plan["复述与计划"]
  confirm["人工确认"]
  edit["执行修改"]
  check["检查结果"]
  record["接受并记录"]
  repair["反馈并修正"]
  stop["停止并记录"]
  goal --> plan
  plan --> confirm
  confirm --> edit
  edit --> check
  check -->|通过| record
  check -->|不符| repair
  repair -->|再检查| check
  check -->|无法继续| stop
